iterations.reply:
The enrichment fetch is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the linker enforces that list. The platform team's approval doesn't change that: until the graph definition actually adds `HTTPClient` to this node, no component that imports `http-client` can be linked. The node's output is unchanged, because the fetch never affected it.

When the graph update ships, the import and the call can be added back. Note that this would send the question text to the metadata host, so the new grant should be scoped with that in mind.

